    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 26,
      "title": {
        "en": "Loving attention from pet groomers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents overwhelmingly praise groomer Reahna for her tender, patient care with puppies, adult dogs, and difficult breeds. Many reviews mention that pets leave calm and looking well-groomed. One dissatisfied customer reported a chaotic nail trim where a large dog was injured and left limping, but other owners report gentle handling and genuine affection from the grooming team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly team with occasional complaints"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple reviewers highlight enthusiastic customer service from associates including Jordan, Alyssa, Michele, and Marlie, noting they help carry supplies, explain rewards programs, and locate specialty items. Conversely, three critical reviews cited poor assistance with heavy bags, rude management attitude regarding wash refunds, and an argumentative groomer during a difficult nail trim."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Appreciated grooming haircuts and trims"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the visual and physical results of baths, brush-outs, and breed-specific cuts. Owners of spaniels, Westies, and doodles report neat scissor work, clean ears, and well-groomed coats that leave pets smelling fresh. Many pet owners note they will return regularly because their dogs look neatly styled and comfortable after their grooming visits."
      }
    }
  ],
